{"seq":3,"slug":"editor-integration","title":"编辑器集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/tree-sitter-ecosystem/editor-integration","wordCount":1065,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"编辑器集成\">编辑器集成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Tree-sitter 的价值不在「解析」本身，而在<strong>解析出的语法树能驱动哪些编辑器功能</strong>。编辑器集成的全部工作，本质上都是「针对某种功能写一份查询文件（<code>.scm</code>），从语法树中提取所需节点」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>查询文件</th>\n<th>提取的信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法高亮</td>\n<td>highlights.scm</td>\n<td>带捕获名的节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码折叠</td>\n<td>folds.scm</td>\n<td>可折叠的节点范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动缩进</td>\n<td>indents.scm</td>\n<td>缩进/反缩进锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部变量</td>\n<td>locals.scm</td>\n<td>作用域与定义-引用关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本对象</td>\n<td>textobjects.scm</td>\n<td>inner/outer 选择范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些查询都建立在同一份 S 表达式语法之上，所以掌握一种查询的写法，其余几种是触类旁通的——这也是本主题学习收益最高的一点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语法高亮\">语法高亮</h2><p>Tree-sitter 的查询系统为语法高亮提供了比正则表达式更精确、更语义化的着色方案。通过 <code>highlights.scm</code> 查询文件定义高亮规则。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scheme\" data-code=\"; highlights.scm — TypeScript 高亮查询示例&#10;&#10;; 关键字&#10;[&quot;if&quot; &quot;else&quot; &quot;for&quot; &quot;while&quot; &quot;return&quot; &quot;function&quot; &quot;class&quot; &quot;const&quot; &quot;let&quot; &quot;var&quot;] @keyword&#10;&#10;; 类型&#10;(type_identifier) @type&#10;(predefined_type) @type.builtin&#10;&#10;; 函数定义&#10;(function_declaration&#10;  name: (identifier) @function)&#10;(method_definition&#10;  name: (property_identifier) @function.method)&#10;&#10;; 函数调用&#10;(call_expression&#10;  function: (identifier) @function.call)&#10;(call_expression&#10;  function: (member_expression&#10;    property: (property_identifier) @function.method.call))&#10;&#10;; 变量&#10;(identifier) @variable&#10;(shorthand_property_identifier) @variable&#10;&#10;; 字面量&#10;(string) @string&#10;(template_string) @string&#10;(number) @number&#10;(true) @boolean&#10;(false) @boolean&#10;(null) @constant.builtin&#10;&#10;; 注释&#10;(comment) @comment&#10;&#10;; 操作符&#10;[&quot;+&quot; &quot;-&quot; &quot;*&quot; &quot;/&quot; &quot;=&quot; &quot;==&quot; &quot;!=&quot; &quot;&lt;&quot; &quot;&gt;&quot; &quot;&amp;&amp;&quot; &quot;||&quot;] @operator&#10;&#10;; 标点&#10;[&quot;(&quot; &quot;)&quot; &quot;{&quot; &quot;}&quot; &quot;[&quot; &quot;]&quot;] @punctuation.bracket&#10;[&quot;,&quot; &quot;;&quot; &quot;:&quot; &quot;.&quot;] @punctuation.delimiter\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; highlights.scm — TypeScript 高亮查询示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 关键字</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[\"if\" \"else\" \"for\" \"while\" \"return\" \"function\" \"class\" \"const\" \"let\" \"var\"] @keyword</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(type_identifier) @type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(predefined_type) @type.builtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 函数定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(function_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: (identifier) @function)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(method_definition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: (property_identifier) @function.method)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 函数调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(call_expression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function: (identifier) @function.call)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(call_expression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function: (member_expression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    property: (property_identifier) @function.method.call))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(identifier) @variable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(shorthand_property_identifier) @variable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 字面量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(string) @string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(template_string) @string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(number) @number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(true) @boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(false) @boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(null) @constant.builtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 注释</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(comment) @comment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 操作符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[\"+\" \"-\" \"*\" \"/\" \"=\" \"==\" \"!=\" \"&#x3C;\" \">\" \"&#x26;&#x26;\" \"||\"] @operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 标点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[\"(\" \")\" \"{\" \"}\" \"[\" \"]\"] @punctuation.bracket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[\",\" \";\" \":\" \".\"] @punctuation.delimiter</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SRC[源代码] --&gt; PARSE[Tree-sitter 解析]&#10;    PARSE --&gt; CST[语法树]&#10;    CST --&gt; QUERY[&quot;highlights.scm 查询&quot;]&#10;    QUERY --&gt; CAPS[&quot;捕获: @keyword, @function, @string, ...&quot;]&#10;    CAPS --&gt; THEME[主题映射]&#10;    THEME --&gt; RENDER[渲染着色]\">graph TD\n    SRC[源代码] --&gt; PARSE[Tree-sitter 解析]\n    PARSE --&gt; CST[语法树]\n    CST --&gt; QUERY[\"highlights.scm 查询\"]\n    QUERY --&gt; CAPS[\"捕获: @keyword, @function, @string, ...\"]\n    CAPS --&gt; THEME[主题映射]\n    THEME --&gt; RENDER[渲染着色]</pre><p>Tree-sitter 高亮 vs 传统 TextMate 语法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Tree-sitter 高亮</th>\n<th>TextMate 语法 (tmLanguage)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>匹配方式</td>\n<td>语法树查询</td>\n<td>正则表达式逐行匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义精度</td>\n<td>高（基于 AST 结构）</td>\n<td>低（纯文本模式匹配）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨行匹配</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n<td>需要复杂的 begin/end 正则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量更新</td>\n<td>仅更新受影响区域</td>\n<td>需要重新匹配整个可见区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误恢复</td>\n<td>错误区域外正常高亮</td>\n<td>错误后可能整段着色错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编写难度</td>\n<td>S 表达式（学习曲线适中）</td>\n<td>嵌套正则（维护困难）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 高亮捕获名称遵循约定层级结构（如 <code>function.method.call</code>）。编辑器主题按从具体到通用的顺序匹配——如果主题未定义 <code>function.method.call</code>，会回退到 <code>function.method</code>，再回退到 <code>function</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"代码折叠\">代码折叠</h2><p>Tree-sitter 的查询可以精确定义代码折叠区域，比传统的缩进级别或大括号匹配更准确。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scheme\" data-code=\"; folds.scm&#10;&#10;(function_declaration&#10;  body: (statement_block) @fold)&#10;&#10;(class_declaration&#10;  body: (class_body) @fold)&#10;&#10;(if_statement&#10;  consequence: (statement_block) @fold)&#10;&#10;(for_statement&#10;  body: (statement_block) @fold)&#10;&#10;(object) @fold&#10;(array) @fold&#10;&#10;(comment) @fold\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; folds.scm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(function_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: (statement_block) @fold)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(class_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: (class_body) @fold)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(if_statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  consequence: (statement_block) @fold)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(for_statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: (statement_block) @fold)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(object) @fold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(array) @fold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(comment) @fold</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;折叠前&quot;&#10;        L1[&quot;function processData(data) {&quot;]&#10;        L2[  const result = [];&quot;]&#10;        L3[&quot;  for (const item of data) {&quot;]&#10;        L4[&quot;    result.push(transform(item));&quot;]&#10;        L5[&quot;  }&quot;]&#10;        L6[&quot;  return result;&quot;]&#10;        L7[&quot;}&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;折叠后&quot;&#10;        F1[&quot;function processData(data) { ... }&quot;]&#10;        F2[&quot;  // 6 行已折叠&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"折叠前\"\n        L1[\"function processData(data) {\"]\n        L2[  const result = [];\"]\n        L3[\"  for (const item of data) {\"]\n        L4[\"    result.push(transform(item));\"]\n        L5[\"  }\"]\n        L6[\"  return result;\"]\n        L7[\"}\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"折叠后\"\n        F1[\"function processData(data) { ... }\"]\n        F2[\"  // 6 行已折叠\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>折叠策略</th>\n<th>定义方式</th>\n<th>精确度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缩进级别</td>\n<td>按缩进深度折叠</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大括号匹配</td>\n<td>匹配 <code>{</code> 和 <code>}</code> 对</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tree-sitter 查询</td>\n<td>按语法节点类型折叠</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动缩进\">自动缩进</h2><p>Tree-sitter 查询可以定义精确的缩进规则，替代传统的正则表达式缩进模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scheme\" data-code=\"; indents.scm&#10;&#10;(statement_block) @indent&#10;(class_body) @indent&#10;(object) @indent&#10;(array) @indent&#10;(arguments) @indent&#10;(formal_parameters) @indent&#10;&#10;&quot;}&quot; @outdent&#10;&quot;]&quot; @outdent&#10;&quot;)&quot; @outdent&#10;&#10;(if_statement&#10;  condition: (_) @indent)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; indents.scm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(statement_block) @indent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(class_body) @indent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(object) @indent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(array) @indent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(arguments) @indent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(formal_parameters) @indent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"}\" @outdent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"]\" @outdent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\")\" @outdent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(if_statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  condition: (_) @indent)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function calculateIndent(tree: Tree, cursorLine: number, tabSize: number): number {&#10;  const node = tree.rootNode.descendantForPosition({ row: cursorLine, column: 0 });&#10;  let indent = 0;&#10;  let current = node;&#10;  while (current.parent) {&#10;    if (isIndentNode(current.parent)) indent += tabSize;&#10;    current = current.parent;&#10;  }&#10;  return indent;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateIndent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cursorLine</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tabSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tree.rootNode.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">descendantForPosition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ row: cursorLine, column: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> indent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current.parent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isIndentNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current.parent)) indent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tabSize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.parent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> indent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>捕获名称</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例节点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>@indent</td>\n<td>子节点应增加缩进</td>\n<td>statement_block, object</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@outdent</td>\n<td>当前行应减少缩进</td>\n<td><code>}</code>、<code>]</code>、<code>)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@aligned</td>\n<td>与参考行对齐</td>\n<td>多行函数参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@dedent</td>\n<td>当前行及后续应减少缩进</td>\n<td>else、catch</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Tree-sitter 缩进查询在换行时计算新行的缩进级别。结合编辑器的 <code>onEnterRules</code>，可以实现非常精准的自动缩进体验。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"局部变量\">局部变量</h2><p>Tree-sitter 查询可以定义作用域和局部变量的语义信息，用于语义高亮和变量着色。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scheme\" data-code=\"; locals.scm&#10;&#10;; 作用域定义&#10;(function_declaration) @scope&#10;(arrow_function) @scope&#10;(for_statement) @scope&#10;(block) @scope&#10;&#10;; 变量定义&#10;(variable_declarator&#10;  name: (identifier) @definition.var)&#10;&#10;(parameter&#10;  (identifier) @definition.parameter)&#10;&#10;(function_declaration&#10;  name: (identifier) @definition.function)&#10;&#10;; 变量引用&#10;(identifier) @reference\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; locals.scm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 作用域定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(function_declaration) @scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(arrow_function) @scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(for_statement) @scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(block) @scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 变量定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(variable_declarator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: (identifier) @definition.var)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(parameter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (identifier) @definition.parameter)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(function_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: (identifier) @definition.function)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; 变量引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(identifier) @reference</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;作用域树&quot;&#10;        GLOBAL[&quot;全局作用域&quot;] --&gt; FN_SCOPE[&quot;function processData 作用域&quot;]&#10;        FN_SCOPE --&gt; FOR_SCOPE[&quot;for 循环作用域&quot;]&#10;        FN_SCOPE --&gt; IF_SCOPE[&quot;if 语句作用域&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;变量解析&quot;&#10;        REF[&quot;引用: item&quot;] --&gt; DEF[&quot;定义: for (const item ...)&quot;]&#10;        REF2[&quot;引用: data&quot;] --&gt; DEF2[&quot;定义: function processData(data)&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"作用域树\"\n        GLOBAL[\"全局作用域\"] --&gt; FN_SCOPE[\"function processData 作用域\"]\n        FN_SCOPE --&gt; FOR_SCOPE[\"for 循环作用域\"]\n        FN_SCOPE --&gt; IF_SCOPE[\"if 语句作用域\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"变量解析\"\n        REF[\"引用: item\"] --&gt; DEF[\"定义: for (const item ...)\"]\n        REF2[\"引用: data\"] --&gt; DEF2[\"定义: function processData(data)\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>捕获名称</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>编辑器用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>@scope</td>\n<td>作用域边界</td>\n<td>限定变量查找范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@definition.var</td>\n<td>变量定义</td>\n<td>定义位置高亮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@definition.parameter</td>\n<td>参数定义</td>\n<td>参数着色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@definition.function</td>\n<td>函数定义</td>\n<td>函数名着色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@reference</td>\n<td>变量引用</td>\n<td>匹配最近定义着色</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文本对象-vim-neovim\">文本对象（Vim/Neovim）</h2><p>在 Neovim 中，Tree-sitter 为 Vim 的文本对象系统提供了语义化扩展。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scheme\" data-code=\"; textobjects.scm&#10;&#10;(function_declaration&#10;  body: (statement_block) @function.inner) @function.outer&#10;&#10;(class_declaration&#10;  body: (class_body) @class.inner) @class.outer&#10;&#10;(if_statement&#10;  consequence: (_) @conditional.inner) @conditional.outer&#10;&#10;(for_statement&#10;  body: (_) @loop.inner) @loop.outer&#10;&#10;(call_expression&#10;  arguments: (arguments) @call.inner) @call.outer&#10;&#10;(parameters&#10;  (parameter) @parameter.inner)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; textobjects.scm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(function_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: (statement_block) @function.inner) @function.outer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(class_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: (class_body) @class.inner) @class.outer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(if_statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  consequence: (_) @conditional.inner) @conditional.outer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(for_statement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: (_) @loop.inner) @loop.outer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(call_expression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  arguments: (arguments) @call.inner) @call.outer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(parameters</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (parameter) @parameter.inner)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>Vim 映射</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>vaf</code></td>\n<td>选中函数</td>\n<td>@function.outer — 整个函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vif</code></td>\n<td>选中函数体</td>\n<td>@function.inner — 函数体内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vac</code></td>\n<td>选中类</td>\n<td>@class.outer — 整个类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vic</code></td>\n<td>选中类体</td>\n<td>@class.inner — 类体内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vai</code></td>\n<td>选中条件</td>\n<td>@conditional.outer — 整个 if</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vii</code></td>\n<td>选中条件体</td>\n<td>@conditional.inner — if 体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>val</code></td>\n<td>选中循环</td>\n<td>@loop.outer — 整个循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>]f</code></td>\n<td>跳到下一函数</td>\n<td>基于 @function.outer 导航</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[f</code></td>\n<td>跳到上一函数</td>\n<td>反向导航</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Tree-sitter 文本对象相比传统的 <code>{</code>/<code>}</code> 段落对象更精确。它能正确处理嵌套结构，例如在嵌套函数中 <code>vif</code> 只选中最内层函数的内容。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((编辑器集成))&#10;    语法高亮&#10;      highlights.scm 查询&#10;      捕获名称层级回退&#10;      增量更新&#10;    代码折叠&#10;      folds.scm 查询&#10;      按语法节点折叠&#10;      比缩进级别更精确&#10;    自动缩进&#10;      indents.scm 查询&#10;      &quot;@indent / @outdent&quot;&#10;      换行时自动计算&#10;    局部变量&#10;      locals.scm 查询&#10;      作用域和定义追踪&#10;      语义高亮着色&#10;    文本对象&#10;      textobjects.scm 查询&#10;      Vim inner/outer 映射&#10;      语义化选择和导航\">mindmap\n  root((编辑器集成))\n    语法高亮\n      highlights.scm 查询\n      捕获名称层级回退\n      增量更新\n    代码折叠\n      folds.scm 查询\n      按语法节点折叠\n      比缩进级别更精确\n    自动缩进\n      indents.scm 查询\n      \"@indent / @outdent\"\n      换行时自动计算\n    局部变量\n      locals.scm 查询\n      作用域和定义追踪\n      语义高亮着色\n    文本对象\n      textobjects.scm 查询\n      Vim inner/outer 映射\n      语义化选择和导航</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>语法高亮</strong>通过 <code>highlights.scm</code> 查询实现，捕获名称支持层级回退（如 <code>function.method.call</code> → <code>function</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>代码折叠</strong>基于语法节点类型（<code>folds.scm</code>），比传统缩进级别和大括号匹配更精确。</li>\n<li><strong>自动缩进</strong>使用 <code>@indent</code>/<code>@outdent</code> 捕获，在换行时计算正确的缩进级别。</li>\n<li><strong>局部变量</strong>通过 <code>locals.scm</code> 追踪作用域和定义-引用关系，支持语义化变量着色。</li>\n<li><strong>文本对象</strong>为 Neovim 提供语义化的 inner/outer 选择操作，精确处理嵌套结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"编辑器集成","id":"编辑器集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"语法高亮","id":"语法高亮"},{"level":2,"text":"代码折叠","id":"代码折叠"},{"level":2,"text":"自动缩进","id":"自动缩进"},{"level":2,"text":"局部变量","id":"局部变量"},{"level":2,"text":"文本对象（Vim/Neovim）","id":"文本对象-vim-neovim"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语法开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/tree-sitter-ecosystem/grammar-development"},"next":{"title":"Tree-sitter WASM 浏览器端解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/tree-sitter-ecosystem/tree-sitter-wasm"}}